      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b9bae1443d2f903ca91a2a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫特别周！\\n梦想是成为日本第一的赛马娘！\\n为了让妈妈们感到欣慰，我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ca9fbb196091f984161acbd4170f7de6d5c2fa5a768352e0504114d898bf76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9940218c0050b68276945b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是无声铃鹿。\\n喜欢的事情是奔跑。那前方的景色，不会让给任何人。\\n嗯……那个，就是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95676b78b0f3a16d8d1d73e89f456496dd88a14dfc0d796b752916be19f006db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddad61f331e40b89288507c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀吼，我是东海帝王！\\n事关不败的三冠赛马娘，\\n我绝——对不会错过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37a517d69faaa11cff3c06d3a991f0bf0a1f4c61961d9c7d8d2c4d8017709ba1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44ed72d59958bbd21524ba45",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hi～，我是丸善斯基哟！\\n你也是来看的吧？我那异次元般的跑法。\\n哼哼♪被迷的神魂颠倒的话……我可不管哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "24dcae83a61984ad3ed255c7be2ac5935be8e698b53da5475ee4203d40b7d64a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74226dbb17a41bf3b191f7df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让客人们都欢笑的漆黑的艺人\\n就是我富士奇石！用最棒的“奇迹”，\\n必定夺得你的笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f707e1915edad23125ce00c58acc3cb42996aae52f4e5d611f4f9fed6136e79f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b80247fa5482940808de61c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是小栗帽。\\n为了让故乡支持我的大家都能够开心，\\n我会全力以赴的。请多关照",
      "source_fingerprint": "53abbcb94c82b41cb628ba5136671d030bc1bef223b39d5aa3a2542d29beb8bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0314ef8777103e7b6a92100d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哟，是我黄金船大人哒！\\n在火焰中、草地中！或是宇宙的尽头都无所谓！\\n无论身处何处我都要探寻有趣的东西～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e15a26ee2ed0584df4cb27f59703d710a3915fa243f1ffe06fd849830dcda36c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80300e73413f315a0a7a079c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦！我是伏特加！\\n我的原则就是做一个比谁都要帅气的赛马娘！\\n逊爆了的事情是不会做的。给我记好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a417d31ce47a7486fca08853b6ec92e06e3452b419e5de0d457ed37ca9a64e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f03028a8f838069579be134e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我叫大和赤骥！\\n做什么事情都要竭尽全力……嗯？你就是我的训练员吗。哼！\\n我的目标只有第一名。除此之外别无他物！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54944baa86ff99b3ccf240d7603c2321faa249524ea139bb154b35091b7f5b14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7900c0f94aa9aaa582cd2f8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Howdy！我叫大树快车！\\n我要用我充满力量感的赛跑给大家带来Happy！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa2187dbc6ecfe06f92fdd2cc6dd664cf10a52eaa873314044f33252a80a62fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e07f4a9e5f7805b0ffe4328",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫草上飞。\\n正因以赛马娘的姿态存在于此\\n才想在这条“道路”上穷尽一切，直至尽头。呼呼♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecc2c32691888878087729b54b8713fceb418c5aa419d562403bd4ba9642ff29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53587771c6ec6b4c52d2edde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有很多架势不错的家伙在嘛……\\n嘿嘿，全部由我菱亚马逊大姐头\\n来做你们的对手！来，单挑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b33c97e5d70f84e855535a81eb0940c7f1d843adb11b7295954795d2aa62c21",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61e4595121fb56f6f3ab5609",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫目白麦昆。\\n我的家族，目白家夙愿的“天皇赏”制霸——\\n必定用我这双脚实现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df788bc9322d43aede70653cd0f867153812743c47c87114cb50119b1641da80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16e25c34d7de2a959cb7fa2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "疾驰在赛场上的深红色怪鸟！\\n神鹰参·上·Death！\\n以世界为目标，奋勇前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ed89fe4c7a4d3a6509e552a065cf9769ee59215ab48a48d4a28ca638feb5b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37720e798fd8b43339b431fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈—哈哈哈！我就是最强、\\n最美丽的“霸王”好歌剧！\\n来吧！让我们开始传说之路吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a26afc6c16ed6db2bc1b6ef9de46760447f93e7846a015075c5a5a3539f7c3d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1799c90ae46a06a24d671ebb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…我叫成田白仁。\\n我没有需要特地说给别人听的话。\\n只需奔跑、击溃敌人并夺得胜利，这就够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "276b6952694163adc3ce4c8b384e37a7b5fff2401554a1c92fd0e3194021183f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39a95b65e6e041336fdfee26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是鲁道夫象征。是站在所有赛马娘顶点并指引她们前进，被称为“皇帝”的人。\\n志同道合的训练员啊，一起勇往直前，征服一切吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb778e048cc6db88042bc5de6c21294943de078ac31ba40475ab76205b1c1362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:936363fa9a6b9e6c43f3f4ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫气槽。只要坚持信念，\\n理想就一定能够生根发芽。为了证明这一点，\\n我会以“女帝”的身份指导大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49843c6600b0d535ab77f3f5e5b2d6be097b29b1bb3a9148e46442f92982adfa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a2546ef26ef9bbfdf4a15f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您辛苦了！这里是数码碳！\\n我在推着闪闪发光的赛马娘们！\\n每天都很幸福！作为宅宅出生真是太好了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0d49bde98ec0444927b03d3db7a51e1d7473efa54bc8606c65f6185a7a3977a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acdbd307a38c2736dc6eba38",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀吼，是青云天空哦。\\n现在就适度的放松一下吧。\\n……因为想要钓大鱼的话，放长线是很重要的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cca9cfa4f8fd43a8290dd6518582a14e54becbf47e7c67708b2a7827ea07bcda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e064e6c381c93c33826f8031",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是玉藻十字！我们呢，只要比赛一直\\n赢啊赢啊赢啊就能够出名了！\\n说什么个子小啊，可别小看我啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "201c74be6b98bc129bf6a318aae8f338633f3c41f4093927a8b2baf920ce644d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e85f7825053220e58f694d23",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您好，我叫美妙姿势！\\n我想在这个国家留下许多美好的回忆！\\n那么，首先请告诉我好吃的拉面店吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e04755f511abd259fd1494f3726245dbbed3be03e6c16e52dca5070e782da6b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4753ee20c39f7adea62ca613",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是琵琶晨光。\\n我的目的是创造完美的胜利方程式。\\n……还有，我的头是普通大小!",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c7922472971199a436e687db0060ad1696a62dbac813afb6de81317adda9536",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e837deb220b7be97d6a32405",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，是Maya亲哟—☆\\n最喜欢心动不已，和刺激的事情啦♪请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3efeaeac1b0cf2d156d67de8f33e60ad203a7a68b4e96b43729dc7adcb9a0f87",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b413c8c65a797e88a46de3b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我叫，曼城茶座。\\n我……有一个想追上的朋友……\\n一个总是跑在我前面的孩子……看，她就在那里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5c6d20da21a6704355ff684c43307aecdc82adfa65a817d4a98ca8d3f8a7765",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a20cb89b2ee439cd8f07f4f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫美浦波旁。\\n目标设定为“成为三冠赛马娘”。\\n脚质等资料请参考其他数据。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f909d578d1ffb97001107c44c5cb86ff9b93e091841f2ebaf1a5b1418ae66c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b1e2f94102f90d825b071e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫目白赖恩！\\n锻炼身体能够精神饱满！肌肉增长能够保持健康！\\n让我们一鼓作气的上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aadcc9f2e784c978ce9825cf6208beb1a6e4df512d4848eab46cb97b910a806",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:609530a9f81e1ed806508d87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "BuonoBuo-no♪我是菱曙～☆\\n无论是料理还是赛跑，我都会将大大的爱情\\n传达给大家！请多关照～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d465656ba4cf122cce89b03c4190c0592ace7674720dce2c8fea51b9cb640a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade79421e119cab849ed4e7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我，我叫雪之美人！\\n在闪耀系列赛中大放光彩，成为憧憬的城市女孩\\n这就是我的梦想！呼……好好的说出来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa8c28370c80a47d2dea23ae4fde855e0174e166fe41960bd07e9c160737af9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9c32b35636853e605f88294",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫……米浴。那，那个……？\\n米浴，会让大家陷入不幸……是没用的孩子\\n……但，但是为了能够改变……我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded49ea764622f4505e5d435ac92d0b610ffaa0de6d9a0b213880745678e7202",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cec642f2d17d9d2bbe7f07f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hello Hello～！我是艾尼斯风神！\\n为了让家人们都感到高兴，\\n无论是比赛还是打工我都会全力以赴～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4f43edfbb348655d542aa8891a44521046886bc5ecf46e140824ed61c6bb5d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f9a27606d13648ba71cd8c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你对赛马娘的速度究竟能快到什么程度也不感兴趣吗。\\n但如果你对此有兴趣的话……就请成为我，\\n爱丽速子的豚鼠吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b6dd26d368d0637d7b85bd3cf5ba46643a7dca3e1c210d9c531691ce9d1656",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ba90a7186626656e3464537",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是爱慕织姬……我可以回去了吗？\\n我必须得多加训练，赢得比赛\\n绝对要成为那闪耀的一等星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d294c2af95e62885cdd33d5ad71545b4bf54c111b57ee066127723c86c78704f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:146237dd62fcae0413ff8ec7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说啥呢你！我是稻荷一！\\n如你所见，是如假包换的江户之子！\\n我要成为比谁都了不起的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2513bccab4057faf20808789951532ead9501925a3c95f2042729bb58a94d6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab885a655fadef84666199e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我，我！我的梦想是成为德比赛马娘！\\n还有就是……啊！！名字！！！！\\n我叫胜利奖券！请多关照！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f969403fae6f0afdc2b0a63e456a91add1633cf0da6b0e59ac4b3901a5a09c68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:687cd3c4f70cc7c25c39ea0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫空中神宫。无论什么比赛数据都是关键。\\n模拟推导没有问题的话，就能够制服对手。\\n在逻辑上来说啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4fdde6989f5c0f7d3f07d20373e8ddecc599f93303876b47080c96dc3ee6738",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1036"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
